FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.27.2-alpine3.23@sha256:9e45f0eb4a63ed37ad6e604950407558b7c738e34e015ae77a5d4ad369cde079 AS build
WORKDIR /src
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download
COPY . .
ARG VERSION=dev
ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=$TARGETOS GOARCH=$TARGETARCH go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w -X main.version=${VERSION}" -o /out/tailbridge ./cmd/tailbridge

FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot@sha256:f5b485ea962d9bd1186b2f6b3a061191539b905b82ec395de78cbfae51f20e35
COPY --from=build /out/tailbridge /tailbridge
USER nonroot:nonroot
ENTRYPOINT ["/tailbridge"]
